// Power Local LLM — Liquid Apollo Review
// Slug: liquid-apollo-review
// Single-product review: Liquid Apollo (App Store ID 6448019325), a hybrid local + cloud AI chat
// client by Liquid AI, Inc. — on-device inference via Liquid AI's LEAP technology and LFM2 models,
// plus optional cloud access to hosted models through a user-supplied OpenRouter API key, plus
// optional custom self-hosted backends (LM Studio, Ollama). This app is NOT local-only; every
// locale block below must state that clearly in the lead answer, not bury it.
// Companion to: private-llm-review, enclave-ai-review-2026, layla-review, arbiter-local-ai-chat-review

